Package: omenfancontrol
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Abdul Rahman <https://github.com/AbdulRahman2257>
Depends: python3.11, python3.11-venv, python3-pip
Description: Fan control and thermal monitoring for HP OMEN laptops on Linux
 Replaces OMEN Hub on Linux. Provides live CPU/GPU temperature monitoring,
 fan control, power profiles, configurable thresholds and system tray icon.
 .
 Optionally requires nvidia-smi for NVIDIA GPU metrics.
Homepage: https://github.com/AbdulRahman2257/omenfancontrol
Section: utils
Priority: optional
